cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite the paper (preferred-citation) and this software record."
type: software
title: "Benchmarking Python Web Frameworks under Generative AI Workloads: benchmark code and data"
abstract: >-
  Controlled benchmark of Flask and Django (Gunicorn sync, 1 and 17 workers),
  FastAPI (Uvicorn) and Tornado as the web layer in front of a hosted LLM API,
  with blocking, SSE streaming and RAG-style pipeline endpoints at 1 to 100
  concurrent users and 5 runs per configuration. Includes the harness, a
  calibrated simulator of the Anthropic Messages API, the raw per-run data, a
  real-API validation and the analysis scripts.
